{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udda9\ud83d\udc0a\ud83d\udc18 WELCOME TO <strong>1000 ANIMALS ON AN ISLAND</strong> \u2014 THE BIGGEST HIDDEN ANIMAL HUNT EVER! \ud83e\udd9c\ud83e\udd9d\ud83e\udd9a</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a massive adventure across a mysterious island filled with <strong>one thousand</strong> unique creatures \u2014 from tiny bugs to legendary beasts!<br>Observe the wildlife, catch pesky critters on the fields, explore beaches, caves, jungles, and mountain peaks \u2014 every animal has its own quirky story to tell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udda6 Is that an otter swimming in the lake?<br>\ud83e\udd85 Did a seagull just steal someone\u2019s sandwich?<br>\ud83e\udd99 And why is there a llama on that roof?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hundreds of funny moments, mini-scenes, and charming surprises scattered all over the island.<br>Test your observation skills and try to <strong>find them all!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923030/extras/c843e566895b772c83773a23c4146d74.poster.avif?t=1761397954\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923030/extras/c843e566895b772c83773a23c4146d74.webm?t=1761397954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923030/extras/c843e566895b772c83773a23c4146d74.mp4?t=1761397954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf34 KEY FEATURES \ud83c\udf34</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udda2 <strong>1000 hidden animals</strong> \u2014 ten times more than before!<br>\ud83d\udc12 <strong>Mini-scenes &amp; interactions</strong> \u2014 animals behave differently in every area.<br>\ud83d\udc1d <strong>A living island</strong> \u2014 farms, jungles, caves, beaches, mountains, and lost villages.<br>\ud83e\udd9c <strong>New funny situations</strong> \u2014 catch pests, rescue animals, find rare species.<br>\ud83e\udd89 <strong>Relaxing soundtrack &amp; cozy atmosphere.</strong><br>\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Hints and secrets</strong> if you ever get stuck.<br>\ud83e\udd88 <strong>No text \u2014 the world tells the story.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2923030?t=1761397954","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923030/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761397954","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923030/116e1c790aa6afc356d24211c5df22099fce5281/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761397954","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923030/116e1c790aa6afc356d24211c5df22099fce5281/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761397954","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udda9\ud83d\udc0a\ud83d\udc18 WELCOME TO <strong>1000 ANIMALS ON AN ISLAND</strong> \u2014 THE BIGGEST HIDDEN ANIMAL HUNT EVER! \ud83e\udd9c\ud83e\udd9d\ud83e\udd9a</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a massive adventure across a mysterious island filled with <strong>one thousand</strong> unique creatures \u2014 from tiny bugs to legendary beasts!<br>Observe the wildlife, catch pesky critters on the fields, explore beaches, caves, jungles, and mountain peaks \u2014 every animal has its own quirky story to tell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udda6 Is that an otter swimming in the lake?<br>\ud83e\udd85 Did a seagull just steal someone\u2019s sandwich?<br>\ud83e\udd99 And why is there a llama on that roof?!</